      "title": "Colors Dinner",
      "section": "dinners",
      "date": "March 2025",
      "blurb": "This one was organised entirely by colour, with each part of the night built around a different one. We wanted to explore how much colour shapes the way we see the world \u2014 the cultural nuances, and what a colour signals to us when we think about food. With many, many exceptions: greens read as bitter, reds and yellows as sweet, browns as savoury, and blues as poisonous.",
